RUN: %PLC -c --fpic %S/interfaces_lib_a.st -o %t.a.o
RUN: %PLC -c --fpic %S/interfaces_lib_b.st -o %t.b.o
RUN: %COMPILE -i %S/interfaces_lib_a.st -i %S/interfaces_lib_b.st %S/interfaces_main.st %t.a.o %t.b.o && %RUN | %CHECK %s

Two independent units that use interfaces are compiled to separate objects and
linked into one program. The symbols generated for the interface fat pointer
type must not be defined more than once.

CHECK: 1
CHECK: 2
